                <span class="xhcs-world-desc">暴雨山庙，古武世家，探灵直播。</span>
              </button>
              <button class="xhcs-world-choice" type="button" data-world="古代修仙" aria-pressed="false">
                <span class="xhcs-world-seal" aria-hidden="true">修</span>
                <span class="xhcs-world-name">古代修仙</span>
                <span class="xhcs-world-desc">残阳山缝，伪神祭祀，河伯旧俗。</span>
              </button>
              <button class="xhcs-world-choice" type="button" data-world="西幻" aria-pressed="false">
                <span class="xhcs-world-seal" aria-hidden="true">誓</span>
